      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing KMS as Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud KMS for key management and decryption. The managed key aspect fits the requirements perfectly. Next steps involve implementation details within `decrypt_payload.py`.\n\n\n**Defining Decryption Logic**\n\nI'm now focusing on the Python implementation for `decrypt_payload.py`. The plan is to create a function that handles decryption with Google Cloud KMS. This function will include the necessary KMS imports, and there will be an example usage section. The implementation will rely on the `google.cloud.kms` client. I'll use the `write` tool to finalize the file creation.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864194896,
          "start": 1789864191639
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc3826970014G27BVjEOszvLx",
