        "text": "**Developing Decryption Script**\n\nI've just finished creating the `decrypt_payload.py` script. I've chosen `google.cloud.kms_v1` as the external provider, evidenced by the import statement and client instantiation. Currently, it includes placeholders for `PROJECT_ID`, `LOCATION_ID`, and a few other key values. I'll need to define the method to handle decryption now.\n\n\n**Finalizing Implementation Details**\n\nThe `decrypt_payload.py` script's construction is now finalized. I've successfully incorporated and documented the placeholders for crucial values like project and key identifiers. The script provides clear guidance on configuring environment variables and installing the required libraries. Essentially, the script is complete.\n\n\n",
