      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Encryption Provider**\n\nI'm focusing on selecting the right encryption provider, with AWS KMS currently looking like a strong contender. The next step is figuring out how to use the provider's SDK or API. I will need to consider key management and encryption implementation details. I will need to begin planning the `encrypt_payload.py` script.\n\n\n**Developing Encryption Script**\n\nI'm now fully immersed in developing the `encrypt_payload.py` script. The plan is to leverage `boto3`, AWS's Python SDK, for interaction with AWS KMS. The script will feature an encryption function, requiring a KMS key ID placeholder for now. I'll handle the plaintext encoding, then use the KMS client's `encrypt` method. The encrypted data will then be returned. The code will be constructed using the `write` tool.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864189463,
          "start": 1789864187034
